  "worked_solution": "First, we equate the real parts:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{3} & =a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we equate the imaginary parts:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2 & =b\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=\\sqrt{3}$ and $b=-2.$",
